! 14ed2 keyboard 2. Identical mapping to keyboard 1 but tuned one ~85.7c step lower
! (note 69 -> 440 / 2^(1/14) = 418.7458673246726 Hz), so a second manual/channel fills
! the degrees keyboard 1 skips at E-F and B-C. Together the two keyboards cover all 14
! degrees of 14-EDO. (The earlier version shifted the middle note instead, which kept the
! same degree set and left degrees 5 and 13 unreachable.)
